<title>CHINA: UBS sets warrants on CITIC Pacific.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on CITIC Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland Hong Kong Branch said on Wednesday it had launched 74 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$50.60	 PREMIUM	    24.82 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.682	 GEARING	    6.75x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   09.JUL.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  22.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     24.JUL.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$46	    EXER LOT	   10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
